  "style": "Neutral Spanish with informal \"tú\" (Crea, Elige, tu sitio), never \"usted\" or \"vosotros\". Sentence case. Buttons use the infinitive, as the catalog already does (Guardar, Publicar, Invitar); instructions use the tú imperative (Añade, Elige). Names and titles in «comillas latinas». Opening ¿ and ¡. A space between a number and its unit (10 MB, 30 días). Decimal comma in prose."
